msgid "I'm still checking the drive. Wait for me, or tap USE MANUAL PORT."
msgstr "Ainda estou verificando a unidade. Espere por mim ou toque em USAR PORTA DE DADOS MANUAL."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: The clerk is the records clerk, the witness; no gendered form for them.
#. i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3154
msgid "WOLF reads the timestamp off his own readout. The clerk's files existed before the deletion order."
msgstr "WOLF lê o carimbo de data e hora no próprio visor. Os arquivos da pessoa arquivista existiam antes da ordem de exclusão."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the engineer's first name.
#. i18n: story speaker=narrator engineer=name
#: scripts/main.gd:3158
#, c-format
msgid "%s copies the timestamp through the maintenance port. WOLF keeps watch."
msgstr "%s copia o carimbo de data e hora pela porta de dados de manutenção. WOLF fica de vigia."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:3174
msgid "Save failed. Use a station to try again."
msgstr "Não foi possível salvar. Use uma estação para tentar de novo."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3244
msgid "The overload breaker catches and the line starts to build. If the LINE gauge peaks, the relief vent lets go."
msgstr "O disjuntor de sobrecarga engata e a linha começa a ganhar pressão. Se o manômetro da LINHA chegar ao máximo, o respiro de alívio cede."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3259
msgid "The wheel is stiff. Three full turns charge the door."
msgstr "O volante está duro. Três voltas completas carregam a porta."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3268
msgid "Relief vent. It lets go when the gauge peaks; don't be standing on it."
msgstr "Respiro de alívio. Ele cede quando o manômetro chega ao máximo; não fique em cima dele."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3277
msgid ""
"No station in reach. The exit bolt is\n"
"by the door."
msgstr ""
"Nenhuma estação ao alcance. O ferrolho da saída\n"
"fica junto à porta."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3280
msgid ""
"No station in reach. The TANK RELEASE\n"
"is past the rubble."
msgstr ""
"Nenhuma estação ao alcance. O painel SOLTAR TANQUE\n"
"fica depois dos escombros."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3283
msgid "No station in reach. The breaker is by the entrance, the valve by the door."
msgstr "Nenhuma estação ao alcance. O disjuntor fica na entrada; a válvula, junto à porta."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3455
msgid "The clamp lets go."
msgstr "A garra se solta."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3546
msgid "SERVICE LINE CLEARED."
msgstr "LINHA DE SERVIÇO LIBERADA."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:3548
msgid "It's quiet now. The line runs on toward Archive."
msgstr "Agora está tudo quieto. A linha segue até o Arquivo."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=engineer engineer=self
#: scripts/main.gd:3550
msgid "Then that's where we go."
msgstr "Então é para lá que vamos."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:3814
msgid "It passes under that tank on every patrol. How do we bring it down?"
msgstr "A sentinela passa sob aquele tanque em cada ronda. Como a derrubamos?"

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3928
msgid "The winch has the tank back on the clamp. The TANK RELEASE is ready again."
msgstr "O guincho prendeu o tanque de volta na garra. O painel SOLTAR TANQUE está pronto de novo."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3960
msgid "FUSE LIT. Back away from the door, past the valve."
msgstr "PAVIO ACESO. Afaste-se da porta, para além da válvula."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: The valve's turns so far and the turns needed (3).
#. i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3964
#, c-format
msgid "The valve gives. %d of %d turns."
msgstr "A válvula cede. %d de %d voltas."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3984
msgid "The relief vent lets go and the breaker trips. Reset the breaker and crank faster this time."
msgstr "O respiro de alívio cede e o disjuntor desarma. Rearme o disjuntor e gire mais rápido desta vez."

